            "review_title": "Review at Cafe Bar Mai 86",
            "review_text": "Bushra V\n8 contributions\n0\nBest salt coffee!\nDec 2024 • Couples\nStopped here because it was one of the only cafes open super early in the morning near our hotel, and I'm so glad we did!!! Best salt coffee I had in Vietnam, to the point where I went back to grab the name so I could find them online and write this review. The owner was really lovely and friendly, and suggested a place nearby where we could grab some food to bring back and have with our coffee. Nice little spot on the street to watch the morning hustle.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 12, 2025",
