            "review_title": "Review at Cafe Bar Mai 86",
            "review_text": "Ella L\n10 contributions\n0\nWonderful family run coffee, tea, juices and beer bar\nJan 2025 • Solo\nPicked this coffee and beer bar by random whilst looking for place to do some emails and have a coffee. Got a spot by the roadside for people watching too. Very friendly local owner who speaks good English. aside from delicious coffee, they also serve tea and fresh orange. Owner says she will be adding some simple snacks eg banh mi in the future. In the meantime there is a great little stall across the road selling chicken wraps which you can bring back to the cafe bar. Enjoyed myself so much went back the next day before heading off to the airport. \n\nPrices are very good also, the cheapest beer I could find!\n\nThis is a mum and daughter owned and run business, just getting off the ground. Please go and support them!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 24, 2025",
